msgid "|view-fullscreen|"
msgstr "|view-fullscreen|"

#: ../../user_interface/monitors.rst:91
msgid ""
"Switch full screen. :ref:`See here for more information "
"<switch_monitor_fullscreen>`."
msgstr ""
"Переключение полноэкранного режима. :ref:`Подробнее см. здесь "
"<switch_monitor_fullscreen>`."

